# SOC Incident Response Playbooks
## Tier 1 SOC Analyst — Standard Operating Procedures

---

### About These Playbooks

These playbooks define the standard response procedures
for the three most common security incidents handled
by a Tier 1 SOC analyst. Each playbook follows the
NIST SP 800-61 incident response framework:

1. Preparation
2. Detection & Analysis
3. Containment
4. Eradication
5. Recovery
6. Lessons Learned

